## Retroactive application

This licence applies retroactively to every earlier version of Aegis, including
those published on npm as `aegis-arun` before this file existed. Versions
`0.1.0`, `0.2.0`, and `0.2.2` were published with a `UNLICENSED` manifest
because no licence had been chosen yet; npm does not allow a published
version's licence to be changed afterwards, so those versions still display
`UNLICENSED` on the registry. The grant above covers them all.